  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "MOCA Mobile Phone Cage Kit is a modular filming kit designed for efficient content creation. Featuring a NATO rail system and 1/4\" standard mounts, it supports quick attachment of accessories like LED lights and microphones. Adaptable for handheld, vertical, and tripod shooting modes. Customizable via 3D printing with color options and pro-grade materials for both daily use and demanding outdoor scenarios."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Anti-Shake Ergonomic Grip: Textured rubber handles with 15° angled design reduce wrist fatigue and minimize shake during handheld filming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Tool-Free NATO Rail System: Dual-side quick-release rails (1/4\" mounts) hold accessories like LED panels (≤500g) without screws – swap in 3 seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "360° Multi-Scene Adapter 360°: Rotatable clamp supports vertical shooting, tripod mounting, and overhead angles with a 90° locking mechanism."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "What phones are compatible? This kit is compatible with devices 60–90mm in width (e.g., iPhone 15 Pro Max/Samsung S24 Ultra)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "What phones are compatible?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This kit is compatible with devices 60–90mm in width (e.g., iPhone 15 Pro Max/Samsung S24 Ultra)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "How to maintain and clean the kit? Wipe rails and mounts with a dry cloth weekly to prevent dust buildup. For stains, use a cotton swab dipped in alcohol. Do not immerse in water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "How to maintain and clean the kit?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Wipe rails and mounts with a dry cloth weekly to prevent dust buildup. For stains, use a cotton swab dipped in alcohol. Do not immerse in water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Are third-party accessories supported? Compatible with all 1/4\" standard accessories (tripods, LED lights, mics). Non-standard accessories require stability testing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Are third-party accessories supported?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compatible with all 1/4\" standard accessories (tripods, LED lights, mics). Non-standard accessories require stability testing."
