  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Overview</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p><strong>MOCA Mobile Phone Cage Kit</strong> is a modular filming kit designed for efficient content creation. Featuring a NATO rail system and 1/4\" standard mounts, it supports quick attachment of accessories like LED lights and microphones. Adaptable for handheld, vertical, and tripod shooting modes. Customizable via 3D printing with color options and pro-grade materials for both daily use and demanding outdoor scenarios.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Feature</h2>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"V1EsdH1SWoZjxaxlwzpcRSchnqh\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IESydTIkjoRMLpxFaopc4M00nZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Anti-Shake Ergonomic Grip</strong>: Textured rubber handles with 15° angled design reduce wrist fatigue and minimize shake during handheld filming.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7ovdF1ONoKGKnxEEK0cc5C1nCg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Tool-Free NATO Rail System</strong>: Dual-side quick-release rails (1/4\" mounts) hold accessories like LED panels (≤500g) without screws – swap in 3 seconds.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjvRdHZ5soCnxRxiDY3cdYlHnRc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>360° Multi-Scene Adapter 360°</strong>: Rotatable clamp supports vertical shooting, tripod mounting, and overhead angles with a 90° locking mechanism.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 125.5px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong> Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 47.1667px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">MOCA Mobile Phone Cage Kit</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"3\" style=\"white-space: pre;\">thrutheframe</span></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1177891\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">MOCA Mobile Phone Cage Kit </a></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 47.1667px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">MOCA Plus Mobile Phone Cage Kit</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"Kurvd84oLoTYrYx6ldHcoTFFnZc\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yr7odFx8MoboTNxM4qtckijAnvg\">thrutheframe</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1249946\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">MOCA Plus Mobile Phone Cage</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>What phones are compatible?</strong></p>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div>This kit is compatible with devices 60–90mm in width (e.g., iPhone 15 Pro Max/Samsung S24 Ultra).</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-CNtNdXUQVoRANCxrfKqcdLUhnDc\"><strong>How to maintain and clean the kit?</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XShmdmkSuoc8wnxI5Zkc88qCnfb\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NSYgdI5LZow62ax6cYmc4Ashnte\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Wipe rails and mounts with a dry cloth weekly to prevent dust buildup. For stains, use a cotton swab dipped in alcohol. <strong>Do not immerse in water.</strong></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Wipe rails and mounts with a dry cloth weekly to prevent dust buildup. For stains, use a cotton swab dipped in alcohol. Do not immerse in water.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+3c*0*1+o\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7386551383364861954\"],\"1\":[\"bold\",\"true\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"d71375af-7a9d-41fb-96e4-f4caf6dab705\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":29,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":144},\"recordId\":\"NSYgdI5LZow62ax6cYmc4Ashnte\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-UcWfddZGtopdfQxTMeCcn9MFnJc\"><strong>Are third-party accessories supported?</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EiZzdyvfHoIOIGxZOlWcJdifnkd\">Compatible with all <strong>1/4\" standard accessories</strong> (tripods, LED lights, mics). Non-standard accessories require stability testing.</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"EtE0dhUD7oalzYxTao2cKrl7nch\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Compatible with all 1/4\\\" standard accessories (tripods, LED lights, mics). Non-standard accessories require stability testing.\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+k*0*1+p*0+29\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7386551383364861954\"],\"1\":[\"bold\",\"true\"]},\"nextNum\":2}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"channel\":\"saas\",\"isEqualBlockSelection\":true,\"pasteRandomId\":\"18dc7813-a2a1-4281-bd8e-c37bc1688e07\",\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":32,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":126},\"recordId\":\"EiZzdyvfHoIOIGxZOlWcJdifnkd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCu